          "en": "but — [PEH-roh]. Contrast with what follows."
        },
        {
          "t": "solo",
          "en": "only — [SOH-loh]. Sole reason: obedience alone."
        },
        {
          "t": "por",
          "en": "because of / for — [pohr]. Cause: por obediencia."
        },
        {
          "t": "obediencia.",
          "en": "obedience — [oh-beh-DYEHN-thyah]. From obedecer; religious submission to rule."
        }
      ]
    },
